2. NEW THEOREM MODULES & PROBES (2026-08-22) — Apache 2.0
==========================================================================

The following modules added on 2026-08-22 are distributed under Apache 2.0
(same terms as the rest of the repository; no per-file marking is used):

- coq/lib/ParetoLaw.v — Pareto law P2/P3/N511 (provability boundary)
- coq/lib/P1Coherence.v — exact-window coherence lower bounds P1/P1'
- coq/lib/ParetoRandom.v — randomized negative law T2a/T2b
- coq/lib/CRTResolve.v — CRT injectivity & prime-ladder resolution
- coq/probes/*.v — 16 z-zone probes (collision characterization C1–C5,
  Parseval equality, window-independent Dirichlet bound, tau trichotomy,
  tolerant Gershgorin, general-dimension tensor, U5 golden near-collision,
  rho^{-3/2} tight bound, etc.); independently compiled, not merged

The self-contained merged files (ca_merged_full_23/24.v) are NOT in this
repository; they are kept in the local archive (30模块) and are covered
by the same Apache 2.0 terms.

